OL,3,ANvidia shares soar after Jensen Huang
OL,4,Areturns as CEO following affair with
OL,5,Aalleged spy
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe AI giant's board says he's the
OL,8,F"right person" to lead, and his return
OL,9,Fis in "the best interests of our
OL,10,Fstockholders, employees, partners and
OL,11,Fcustomers"
OL,13,FDonald Trump - who has pushed for
OL,14,FHuang's reinstatement - calls him a
OL,15,F"great patriot" and says the US
OL,16,Fgovernment has "no reason to believe"
OL,17,Fhis return poses a national security
OL,18,Frisk
OL,20,FHuang says: "I take this responsibility
OL,21,Fwith the greatest humility and renewed
OL,22,Fcommitment" - read his full statement
